{"id":"MOEX-113020-1301-Q095","title":"複合體IV是細胞色素c氧化酶，將電子交給氧","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med1","sourceSha256":"311766a008de4cd486451d5cf3ace651e21626ab07aac13eb730273a6bb8da80","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_b848a20b2aa881918b9ed1a6290c803d","sourceAnchor":"q95","shortHtml":"<p>答案為 <strong>B：細胞色素氧化酶</strong>，更完整的名稱是<strong>細胞色素c氧化酶（cytochrome c oxidase）</strong>。它就是粒線體電子傳遞鏈的<strong>複合體IV</strong>，負責把電子交給氧，將氧還原為水。</p>","html":"<div><h2>複合體IV是細胞色素c氧化酶，將電子交給氧</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：B</p><p>答案為 <strong>B：細胞色素氧化酶</strong>，更完整的名稱是<strong>細胞色素c氧化酶（cytochrome c oxidase）</strong>。它就是粒線體電子傳遞鏈的<strong>複合體IV</strong>，負責把電子交給氧，將氧還原為水。</p>\n<h3>四個選項正好對應四個複合體</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>複合體</th><th>代表名稱</th><th>電子傳遞位置</th><th>選項</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>I</td><td>NADH去氫酶</td><td>接受NADH電子，再傳給輔酶Q</td><td>A</td></tr>\n<tr><td>II</td><td>琥珀酸去氫酶</td><td>將琥珀酸氧化所得電子傳給輔酶Q</td><td>C</td></tr>\n<tr><td>III</td><td>輔酶Q—細胞色素c氧化還原酶；亦稱bc₁複合體</td><td>由還原態輔酶Q傳給細胞色素c</td><td>D</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>IV</strong></td><td><strong>細胞色素c氧化酶</strong></td><td><strong>由還原態細胞色素c傳給O₂，形成H₂O</strong></td><td><strong>B</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:544px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.1774891774891776\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/c1c40bfc5126ec8f383dbdfa9292cfe1ebeb4cc596c7c3134f630b08bcb9b2ec.jpg\" alt=\"粒線體內膜電子傳遞鏈，I與II將電子送至Q，再經III、細胞色素c、IV到氧\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"544\" height=\"462\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/c1c40bfc5126ec8f383dbdfa9292cfe1ebeb4cc596c7c3134f630b08bcb9b2ec.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>複合體IV位在電子通往氧的末段。圖：OpenStax，General Biology 1e，Figure 7.4.1；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://bio.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Introductory_and_General_Biology/General_Biology_1e_(OpenStax)/2:_The_Cell/07:_Cellular_Respiration/7.4:_Oxidative_Phosphorylation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。完整圖版，未改標。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>先認方向：上方是<strong>膜間腔</strong>，下方是<strong>粒線體基質</strong>。沿電子箭頭讀<strong>NADH→I→Q→III→Cyt c→IV→O₂</strong>；II是另一個進入Q的入口。圖中II旁的FADH₂／FAD是將酵素內輔基的還原與氧化簡寫出來，不是讓游離FADH₂在膜間來回搬運。</p>\n<h3>細胞色素c不等於細胞色素c氧化酶</h3>\n<p><strong>細胞色素c</strong>是III與IV之間的可移動電子攜帶者；<strong>細胞色素c氧化酶</strong>才是接受它所帶電子的IV。名稱多了「氧化酶」，功能與所指結構就不同。</p>\n<p>原題D寫ubiquinone:cytochrome c oxidoreductase，指向III；實際將電子交給III的是還原態輔酶Q，即<strong>泛醇（ubiquinol，QH₂）</strong>。判讀時把Q／QH₂視為同一攜帶系統的氧化與還原形式，就不會誤選成IV。</p>\n<h3>延伸：電子流與質子流不是同一條箭頭</h3>\n<p>I、III、IV可將質子由基質側移向膜間腔，建立跨內膜的電化學梯度；II不直接泵出質子。之後ATP合成酶利用質子回流來合成ATP。因而<strong>IV負責末端電子傳遞</strong>，並不是直接把ADP接上磷酸的ATP合成酶。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（一）原題，第95題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：更正後答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/68003576\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Electron Transport Complex IV — NLM MeSH</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3243592/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Arrangement of electron transport chain components in bovine mitochondrial supercomplex I1III2IV1</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC552927/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Structure of a mitochondrial supercomplex formed by respiratory-chain complexes I and III</a></li><li><a href=\"https://bio.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Introductory_and_General_Biology/General_Biology_1e_(OpenStax)/2:_The_Cell/07:_Cellular_Respiration/7.4:_Oxidative_Phosphorylation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax，General Biology 1e，Figure 7.4.1</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：B"}